  "shownotes_html": "<p><span>40 岁上下的我们有这样的疑惑：</span></p><span></span><p><span>有人工作稳定得像公务员，心里却每隔两三天就要“呐喊”和“奋斗一下”</span></p><span></span><p><span>有人体制内勤勤恳恳十一年，却觉得床垫下总有“一颗豌豆”</span></p><span></span><p><span>有人职业生涯自由洒脱，却坦言每一次很酷的转折都是被逼无奈</span></p><span></span><p><span>人到中年，到底是该安逸，还是继续折腾？</span></p><span></span><p><span>每一个自我发问“这辈子是不是就这样了”的时刻，我们在拧巴些什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期节目里，我和大武、罗叔坐在一起，诚实地面对自己的不甘和那点没熄灭的火苗。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎加入，中年俱乐部。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlGb4Z5SKNWe6J6eN_p_dwVXXhzk.jpg\"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>嘉宾：</span></strong><span>罗叔（</span><a href=\"https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5e284c38418a84a04626372e?s=eyJ1IjogIjYxZjQyMGM4MmNiZDdjMDE3NjYyZjNmZSJ9\" data-url=\"https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5e284c38418a84a04626372e?s=eyJ1IjogIjYxZjQyMGM4MmNiZDdjMDE3NjYyZjNmZSJ9\"><span>头号玩家</span></a><span>） 羊行</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播：</span></strong><span>大武（</span><a href=\"https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65e47b2ecfdcad8d2c5a2153\" data-url=\"https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65e47b2ecfdcad8d2c5a2153\"><span>武湖四海</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>录制日期：</span></strong><span>2026年2月28日</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>发布日期：</span></strong><span>2026年3月9日</span></p><span></span><figure><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvXBgmBTYAz66heWb-IMbWGG4iMT.jpg\"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"39\">00:39</a> 三个中年人，三种人生困局</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"436\">07:16</a> 罗叔回应“被洪晃甩了”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"570\">09:30</a> “保下限”还是“拼上限”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"831\">13:51</a> 当职场野心遇上亲子陪伴，你会如何选择？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1046\">17:26</a> 当你觉得自己很棒，你其实在走下坡路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1138\">18:58</a> 你人生的“关键词”是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1345\">22:25</a> 怎么变现？你有什么就吃什么！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1650\">27:30</a> 播客不是一个赛道，是花园</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1915\">31:55</a> 在一个朝九晚五的稳定工作里，如何突破？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2249\">37:29</a> 时代的列车在我身边呼啸而过</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2475\">41:15</a> 自由职业反而让我觉得更稳定</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2683\">44:43</a> 人到中年，最重要的是稳定吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2875\">47:55</a> 同学聚会，你会焦虑吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3319\">55:19</a> 每天进步一点点，但是如何衡量？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3649\">01:00:49</a> 其实我们更害怕的，是失去可能性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3752\">01:02:32</a> 所以，什么是“更棒的人”？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlRBNme5BCGPmi7tDKTTEEd1mPM0.jpg\"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>配乐：</span></strong><span>片头：邓泽西 - 毒蘑菇</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾：HONNE - HAPPY DAY</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>制作：</span></strong><a href=\"https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/6497ea29000000000a0231f6?xsec_token=YBJZuIZKB8--qhey6fLUjnly_yIKoF5EGXCtmpoxJRe3Y=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=6497ea29000000000a0231f6&amp;apptime=1743415208&amp;share_id=f49cf1e341ae4fa387de0742b1aaa503\" data-url=\"https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/6497ea29000000000a0231f6?xsec_token=YBJZuIZKB8--qhey6fLUjnly_yIKoF5EGXCtmpoxJRe3Y=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=6497ea29000000000a0231f6&amp;apptime=1743415208&amp;share_id=f49cf1e341ae4fa387de0742b1aaa503\"><span>@播客制作人老段</span></a></p><span></sp